      "body": "## Summary\nFixes multi-turn Mean TPOT inflation under EAGLE/NEXTN on Ascend NPU by:\n1. Preferring running decode over starting new waiting prefills (including chunked continuations) when speculative decoding is active and mixed-chunk is off\n2. Resetting a disabled \\chunked_prefill_size\\ (\\<= 0\\) to **1024** for the EAGLE family\n\n## Ascend issue\n- https://github.com/Ascend/sglang/issues/1093\n- Claimed by: **BaiBaiUu**\n\n## NPU retest (Atlas 800T A2)\nBench: \\sglang.benchmark.serving\\ · generated-shared-prefix · turns=3 · C=2 · A=p=2\\ · B=p=8\\ · Qwen3-Next-80B + NEXTN\n\nS4 (decode-prefer V2 + chunked 1024): **10/10 PASS** (\\|Δ Mean TPOT| ≤ 1 ms\\)\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] NPU A/B retest matrix (see Ascend issue comments / local RETEST)\n- [ ] Upstream CI / maintainer un-ci\n## Note\nReplaces LongCatchen PR #40518 (wrong account for this claim). Closing that PR in favor of this one.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38061968181](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38061968181)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38061967967](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38061967967)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38061968155](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38061968155)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
